s10-5-p18 : Block
s10-5-p18 = prose (cons "The semicolon in the return/fault cases denotes one state update together with waiter notification. The producer table is indexed by the semantic key and effect scope \( (k,\omega) \); an external request has a fresh per-occurrence token \(\iota\) within that scope, and a response is accepted only for the corresponding outstanding token. A consumed or retired token cannot resume a continuation twice. Source-syntax equality does not authorize reuse of an effect occurrence." nil)
